akeholder": 0, "developing": 0, "resilience": 0, "decision": 0}, "note": "", "comments": {}, "overall": 0}]}], "a": [{"id": "p1785224589897", "type": "achievement", "target": "m3", "from": "m3", "category": "Process Improvement", "skillKey": "sales", "selfRating": 1, "impact": "Aligned OPO to dial with Incubation data, as the relative response rate on those was higher and connectivity was about 25%, way higher than the general startup list which connectivity %of less 1% \n\nThis impacted creating a strong BOFU of 6 MTUs and 22 scheduled meetings, with only 95 as the base for \"Startup Bihar Cohort Only\"", "text": "This was A/B testing to check relative improvement in the funnel for Incubation, as we are constrained on resources and we had to scale this specific inflow on leads.", "ref": "", "date": "2026-07-28T07:43:09.897Z", "approvedDate": "2026-07-28T07:44:18.687Z"}, {"id": "p1785222475075", "type": "feedback", "from": "m2", "target": "m7", "sentiment": "positive", "text": "Mary has been a dependable and proactive member of the team. She consistently ensures that operational processes run smoothly and is always willing to support the team whenever required.\n\nShe is approachable, responsive, and quick to resolve operational issues, which helps minimise blockers and enables the team to focus on execution. Her coordination across different stakeholders and attention to detail have made day-to-day operations much more efficient.\n\nOverall, Mary has made a meaningful contribution to the team's success through her strong operational support, collaboration, and commitment to delivering high-quality work.", "date": "2026-07-28T07:07:55.075Z", "approvedDate": "2026-07-28T07:44:21.086Z"}], "c": {"m7": {"ai": [{"text": "Need to automate more process in the required alignment of Ops and reduce dependancy", "date": "2026-07-27T10:54:46.252Z"}]}, "m1": {"reporting": [{"text": "Must built a dedicated pipeline with clear list to have better tracking on overall available base and funnel", "date": "2026-07-27T11:09:25.715Z"}, {"text": "Leads in funnel needs to be positioned better, as leads marked under NI are not correct reporting", "date": "2026-07-27T11:09:17.148Z"}], "independence": [{"text": "Has improved, however needs to reduce this further 10% on specifics of escalations & pricing.", "date": "2026-07-27T11:09:51.264Z"}], "ai": [{"text": "Need to start building more with AI for her & team optimization.", "date": "2026-07-27T11:10:08.281Z"}], "comms": [{"text": "Need to improve professional tone of discussion ; over platform like Whatsapp & Gmail.", "date": "2026-07-27T11:10:49.870Z"}]}, "m2": {"ai": [{"text": "Haven't adopted or implemented any AI workflows or tools. Need improve this significantly.", "date": "2026-07-28T06:53:58.675Z"}], "reporting": [{"text": "Grown well, but yet reporting breaks at multiple instance on GMV & Competition data sync. Leading to offsetting numbers on POD dashboard.", "date": "2026-07-28T06:55:17.890Z"}], "comms": [{"text": "Good at it, however do have misses over email ; which leads to escalation in certain cases.", "date": "2026-07-28T06:59:08.974Z"}]}, "m6": {"reporting": [{"text": "Good, need to improve on overall reporting for herself and her POD", "date": "2026-07-28T07:21:17.179Z"}], "maturity": [{"text": "As an associate manager, Management on client specific issues/request + team related concerns needs to addressed better. \nEg ; Muni Broking & Trackk constant nudge on pricing", "date": "2026-07-28T07:23:04.180Z"}], "ai": [{"text": "Haven't scaled or built any automation directly or indirectly for own-self & team", "date": "2026-07-28T07:23:41.330Z"}]}, "m8": {"sales": [{"text": "Growing on PG sales, yet to scale on GMV focused brands.", "date": "2026-07-28T08:54:04.768Z"}], "independence": [{"text": "Growing, this owed to POS to PG transition.", "date": "2026-07-28T08:54:59.668Z"}], "xfunc": [{"text": "Yet to scale and utilize cross-functional alignments with other POD ; Owed to POS to PG transition", "date": "2026-07-28T08:57:43.454Z"}]}, "m3": {"reporting": [{"text": "Number tracking sits mediocre and needs to grow", "date": "2026-07-28T09:02:40.488Z"}, {"text": "Broken on document preparation ; steep learning curve on presenting data cuts. Bi-weekly connect haven't had transition on deeper analysis of data.", "date": "2026-07-28T09:02:22.938Z"}], "ai": [{"text": "Yet to develop and built any automation or workflow to grow and increase team input to output metrics", "date": "2026-07-28T09:03:28.373Z"}], "enthusiasm": [{"text": "Good, but yet it lacks the energy required in the respective leading POD. Provided startup is high-turnaround and fast moving charter.", "date": "2026-07-28T09:04:28.621Z"}]}, "m4": {"maturity": [{"text": "High resistance on basic requirements as sales POC and POD leaders are sometimes pushed to delay. But have seen steep improvement.", "date": "2026-07-28T09:12:03.589Z"}], "escalation": [{"text": "Escalations revolve often around non-profoundness of Magic Checkout.", "date": "2026-07-28T09:13:43.942Z"}]}}, "h": {"m7": {"reporting": [{"id": "h1785149563787", "text": "Improved the documentation at bird-eye view, helping to track progress of each request made", "type": "reference", "ref": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1kfLHAnDjqzozGNer4-BtwQkpR1cwyfoP8PNJ4TZjIec/edit?gid=1608153264#gid=1608153264", "date": "2026-07-27T10:52:43.787Z"}], "ai": [{"id": "h1785149636685", "text": "Build the DS Dashboard ; For Easy Tracking of ticket status cross referenced with Freshdesk", "type": "process", "ref": "https://ds-ops-react.vercel.app/", "date": "2026-07-27T10:53:56.685Z"}, {"id": "h1785149668285", "text": "Created an Automated workflow for MCC request ↗", "type": "process", "ref": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1iN4MYc_xa6V%E2%80%A6/edit?gid=0#gid=0", "date": "2026-07-27T10:54:28.285Z"}]}, "m2": {"sales": [{"id": "h1785221676442", "text": "Nubra ; Zanksar [ >1Million Funded Startup]", "type": "deal", "ref": "", "dat